#   ✔ Wallpaper: the one on screen · random of the rice · any picture ·
#     a VIDEO playing behind the lock (VideoWall + a transparent i3lock)
#   ✔ Effects: none · dim · blur · dimblur · pixel · dimpixel · color
#   ✔ Now playing + a custom message baked at lock time
#   ✔ Writes ~/.config/betterlockscreen/betterlockscreenrc, so even a
#     plain `betterlockscreen -l` gets this look
#   ✔ Auto-lock when idle and before suspend (xss-lock)
#   ✔ The same card is the LightDM login screen: --prepare also feeds the
#     lightdm-webkit2-greeter theme "techogr" (wallpaper, avatar, colors)
